unt":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我是真的接受程度很高所以恶俗程度很高的人。这个小猫爪背地里藏的秘密还是太多了","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2077976035782762525"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2073996961930469447","created_at":"2026-07-06T05:06:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2073996961930469447"],"id":"2073996961930469447","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":973,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"加拿大我真的有点恨你了…除了 Lululemon 还有什么得体的衣服可以穿，真的不想每天都穿同样不同颜色的 hoodie 配长短不一的 leggings和不一样的吊带了…加拿大到底有谁在时尚…","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2073996961930469447"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2073280479906947163","created_at":"2026-07-04T05:39:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2073280479906947163"],"id":"2073280479906947163","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":765,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"感觉自己淡到快出家了，对别人的生活毫不感兴趣，也不喜欢别人窥探我的生活","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2073280479906947163"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2071843474656395667","created_at":"2026-06-30T06:29:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071843474656395667"],"id":"2071843474656395667","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":756,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"miss his hug…forever\nplzzzz","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2071843474656395667"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2071468856112201868","created_at":"2026-06-29T05:40:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071468856112201868"],"id":"2071468856112201868","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":839,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我的🥛你怎么了😭😭😭气球都没我左边奶瘪的快，大小胸我跟你没完…","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2071468856112201868"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2069581441781084469","created_at":"2026-06-24T00:40:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069581441781084469"],"id":"2069581441781084469","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":720,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不得不说 我是一个完全没有社交动力的人…","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2069581441781084469"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2068850656224620740","created_at":"2026-06-22T00:16:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068850656224620740"],"id":"2068850656224620740","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":681,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这么多年没在 x 上被现生朋友私信过是不是因为大家都太善良了选择不告诉我…还是我真的没被朋友发现。如果被发现了还是不要告诉我的好…","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2068850656224620740"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2064220592912609450","created_at":"2026-06-09T05:38:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2064220592912609450"],"id":"2064220592912609450","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1528,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"虽然你晚上给我狠狠上了一课，但是我还是要说年上牛逼。这辈子都会为了老男人再次心软","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2064220592912609450"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2064054594632876393","created_at":"2026-06-08T18:38:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2064054594632876393"],"id":"2064054594632876393","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":758,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实跟他吃的也蛮好的了，身体上是完全满足，心理上是逐渐不满足。身材得到所有人一致好评，练的是真不错，心也是真的硬。就算一段美好的回忆了，倒也是想不起来那么多细节了，估计是早知道有这样的结局所以故意没让自己记住，当时是幸福的就够了。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2064054594632876393"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2063860382016672236","created_at":"2026-06-08T05:47:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063860382016672236"],"id":"2063860382016672236","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3930,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这辈子都不会再碰 situationship","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2063860382016672236"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2060746489564135679","created_at":"2026-05-30T15:33:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2060746489564135679"],"id":"2060746489564135679","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":807,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每次搬家都是一次巨大的精神折磨","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2060746489564135679"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2060597375715233853","created_at":"2026-05-30T05:41:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2060597375715233853"],"id":"2060597375715233853","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":769,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我是可以一个人完成所有，也可以一个人面对恐惧，但是我想如果有人在我会好很多。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2060597375715233853"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2060250016783151228","created_at":"2026-05-29T06:40:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2060250016783151228"],"id":"2060250016783151228","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":730,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最后所有的不甘，稀碎的痛苦都被演化成了幸福的一部分，连未曾说出口的爱意也是其中之一。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2060250016783151228"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2057336996016910476","created_at":"2026-05-21T05:45:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2057336996016910476"],"id":"2057336996016910476","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":796,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最想他的时候，买完麦麦跑到他家楼下看看有没有亮灯。一看黑黑的一片，想想就是还没忙完。但是突然发现自己不知道他家具体是哪间，所以笑了笑转身又走了。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2057336996016910476"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2055891893884740068","created_at":"2026-05-17T06:03:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2055891893884740068"],"id":"2055891893884740068","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":837,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"世界上最难受的事莫过于在旅游的过程中发现被朋友当成 tt 玩弄于股掌之中，我始终无法接受被当成“小情侣”play 的一环…回去之后收拾收拾保持距离吧","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2055891893884740068"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2055396745568481315","created_at":"2026-05-15T21:15:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2055396745568481315"],"id":"2055396745568481315","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":742,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"真的还会见吗…","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2055396745568481315"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2053340139917820261","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:03:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2053340139917820261"],"id":"2053340139917820261","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":799,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你猫又要开始每天爬坡一小时了，备战会展就是这么努力自律。btw 大家都去看 twice 新国立演唱会，爬坡的时候看这个时间过去超快，完美实现无痛爬坡","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2053340139917820261"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2052845470595362980","created_at":"2026-05-08T20:17:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2052845470595362980"],"id":"2052845470595362980","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":728,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我也没多大啊，但是已经没办法接熬夜哭泣了。一点半睡对我来说已经无法接受了，头痛欲裂的一天真的有种上了年纪做什么都很心酸的感觉。现在好了，连难受都要发生在 12 点之前，要不然影响第二天的状态实在是不太好受","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/2052845470595362980"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"2052260760592736383","created_at":"2026-05-07T05:34:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["20522607